Requires Python3, Pillow, NumPy, SciPy and ffmpeg. Run python source/rebuild.py PATH_TO_EXTRACTED_ACTOR. Source ZIP includes original reference, native drawings, prompts, config, QA and this deterministic builder. Runtime animation.json defines 60Hz holds, pixel pivot and exact atlas rectangles. Hit is nonlooping and returns to the existing baseline movement clip; defeat is nonlooping and holds the final inert remnant. Events are visual references only, not combat logic. No root motion is encoded.
